        {
          "block_label": "paragraph_title",
          "block_content": "4、划线部分是“时间”，特殊疑问词whattime或when ",
          "block_bbox": [
            385,
            467,
            1794,
            519
          ],
          "block_id": 0,
          "block_order": 1
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "如:lt's seven twenty . ---What time is it?",
          "block_bbox": [
            376,
            598,
            1379,
            647
          ],
          "block_id": 1,
          "block_order": 2
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "Iusually get up at six.---Whendo you usuallygetup?",
          "block_bbox": [
            377,
            729,
            1752,
            781
          ],
          "block_id": 2,
          "block_order": 3
        },
        {
          "block_label": "paragraph_title",
          "block_content": "5、划线部分是“年龄”，特殊疑问词howold ",
          "block_bbox": [
            387,
            986,
            1532,
            1037
          ],
          "block_id": 3,
          "block_order": 4
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "如:Iam twelve.---Howold are you?",
          "block_bbox": [
            377,
            1119,
            1278,
            1168
          ],
          "block_id": 4,
          "block_order": 5
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "My father is thirty-three .---Howold is your father ur father?",
          "block_bbox": [
            380,
            1238,
            1710,
            1302
          ],
          "block_id": 5,
          "block_order": 6
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "ur father?6、划线部分是“职业”，特殊疑问词what 如:Mike isa worker.---WhatisMike ",
