      "markdown": "## 4、 划线部分是“时间”，特殊疑问词whattime或when \n\n如:lt's seven twenty . ---What time is it?\n\nIusually get up at six.---Whendo you usuallygetup?\n\n## 5、 划线部分是“年龄”，特殊疑问词howold \n\n如:Iam twelve.---Howold are you?\n\nMy father is thirty-three .---Howold is your father ur father?\n\nur father?6、划线部分是“职业”，特殊疑问词what 如:Mike isa worker.---WhatisMike \n\n7、划线部分是“颜色”特殊疑问词用whatcolour 如:My hat is blue-What colour is your hat?\n\n### 8. 划线部分是“数量”，特殊疑问词howmany或howmuch \n\n如:Ican see five kites .--How many kites can you see?\n\nThere is some milk in the glass.---How much milk is there in the glass?\n\n### 9. 划线部分是“多少钱”，特殊疑问词howmuch \n\n如:This pen is nine yuan.---How much is this pen?",
